Blair</surname><given-names>PL</given-names></name><name><surname>Grainger</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Moch</surname><given-names>JK</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title>Discovery of gene function by expression profiling of the malaria parasite life cycle.</article-title><source>Science</source><volume>301</volume><fpage>1503</fpage><lpage>1508</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12893887</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0002386-Shock1"><label>10</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Shock</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Fischer</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>DeRisi</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><year>2007</year><article-title>Whole-genome analysis of mRNA decay in Plasmodium falciparum reveals a global lengthening of mRNA half-life during the intra-erythrocytic development cycle.</article-title><source>Genome Biology</source><volume>8</volume><fpage>R134</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17612404</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0002386-Radke1"><label>11</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Radke</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></name><name><surname>Behnke</surname><given-names>MS</given-names></name><name><surname>Mackey</surname><given-names>AJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Radke</surname><given-names>JB</given-names></name><name><surname>Roos</surname><given-names>DS</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>The transcriptome of Toxoplasma gondii.</article-title><source>BMC Biol</source><volume>3</volume><fpage>26</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16324218</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0002386-Gajria1"><label>12</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gajria</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Bahl</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Brestelli</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Dommer</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Fischer</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2008</year><article-title>ToxoDB: an integrated Toxoplasma gondii database resource.</article-title><source>Nucleic Acids Res</source><volume>36</volume><fpage>D553</fpage><lpage>556</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18003657</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0002386-Florens1"><label>13</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Florens</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Washburn</surname><given-names>MP</given-names></name><name><surname>Raine</surname><given-names>JD</given-names></name><name><surname>Anthony</surname><given-names>RM</given-names></name><name><surname>Grainger</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2002</year><article-title>A proteomic view of the Plasmodium falciparum life cycle.</article-title><source>Nature</source><volume>419</volume><fpage>520</fpage><lpage>526</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12368866</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0002386-Jomaa1"><label>14</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jomaa</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Wiesner</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Sanderbrand</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Altincicek</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Weidemeyer</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>1999</year><article-title>Inhibitors of the nonmevalonate pathway of isoprenoid biosynthesis as antimalarial drugs.</article-title><source>Science</source><volume>285</volume><fpage>1573</fpage><lpage>1576</lpa